        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: cream, white silk (weft rib). Design: small flowering plants and trees, growing from small plots of ground, plots woven (brochée) with flat gilded silver, trees with gilded silver wound on cream colored silk, and flowering plants with pink, reddish violet, and green silk; lace-like pattern in ground, formed by weft float. Worn, pieced, metal thread tarnished."@en ;
